task.action:
- Create script that takes a quick ID as argument
- Look for .kanban/quick/{id}/quick.xml
- Return JSON with id, filename, path, title, created, updated
- Parse quick.xml to extract metadata
- Follow tagged union error pattern on failure

Reference (find-task.cjs):
```javascript
function findTaskFile(id) {
  const taskPath = path.join(TASKS_DIR, id, "task.xml");
  if (fs.existsSync(taskPath)) return taskPath;
  return null;
}
```

Change to:
```javascript
function findQuickFile(id) {
  const quickPath = path.join(QUICK_DIR, id, "quick.xml");
  if (fs.existsSync(quickPath)) return quickPath;
  return null;
}
```
